          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Max Payne 2: The Fall of Max Payne",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Max Payne 2 is a third-person shooter, in which the player assumes the role of Max Payne, but also plays as Mona Sax in a few levels. Initially, the player's weapon is a 9mm pistol. As they progress, players access other weapons including other handguns, shotguns, submachine guns, assault rifles, sniper rifles, and hand-thrown weapons. To move the game along, the player is told what the next objective is through Max's internal monologue, in which Max iterates what his next steps should be.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Max Payne 2 es un shooter en tercera persona en el que el jugador asume el papel de Max Payne, pero también controla a Mona Sax en algunos niveles. Al principio, el arma del jugador es una pistola de 9 mm. A medida que avanza, puede acceder a otras armas, como otras pistolas, escopetas, subfusiles, fusiles de asalto, fusiles de francotirador y armas arrojadizas. Para avanzar en el juego, el jugador recibe el siguiente objetivo a través del monólogo interior de Max, en el que este repasa cuáles deben ser sus próximos pasos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2003",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
